{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1533","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"历史是一面镜子，它映照着现实，也预示着未来。了解历史，不忘过去，才能看清前进的方向；尊重历史，以史为鉴，才能更好地走向未来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"历史著作在中国古代文化典籍中占有重要的位置。本单元选入了《史记》《汉书》中的两篇经典作品，我们可以从中窥见古代史家的历史观念、开创精神；选入的两篇史论，均意在劝诫，总结历史经验教训，为当时的社会政治服务，其观点至今仍然具有借鉴价值。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，要“回到历史现场”，鉴赏作品的叙事艺术和说理艺术，领会其中体现的历史观念、家国情怀和担当精神；理解史家对笔下人物的认识和评价，把握论者的观点和论述方式，学习和借鉴他们思考社会现实问题的态度和方法；丰富文言文的语言积累，学会在具体语境中分辨词语的意义和用法，把握古今汉语的差异与联系。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":61191,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/e/ede4e3c7aa15f2a363fea42671889de4dfd2d160.jpeg","height":1146,"id":"media-74be2dbe7f44476d0088","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"541ad2f5fcea74015a884190d526e100a51afa2ed885b1e1782d204a39d19b9c","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/e/ede4e3c7aa15f2a363fea42671889de4dfd2d160.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":807}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10247,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/e/ede4e3c7aa15f2a363fea42671889de4dfd2d160.jpeg","post